  "format_and_custody": [
    "Legacy v2 SCHEMA/FIELDS/quoteObject/quoteBytes preserve original 1MiB closed-shape/decimal/canonical contract. New strict v3 uses planning_request_ref instead of inline; explicit text version and exact fieldsets reject unknown/missing/null/nontext schemas, hybrids and extra fields; no error fallback.",
    "Representation changes only when complete original PlanningWire encoded bytes exceed1MiB. Small plans use v2 even if another field overflows manifest, without extra CAS. Reject >64MiB before sidecar write; PlanningWire256MiB capacity is not FullMaterial permission.",
    "Same held writer FullMaterial CAS preserves original full bytes, loadFullMaterial actually reopens and exact len/SHA plus every-byte producer readback checked. verify and originalRequest share strict loader and actually reopen full material on each read, no metadata-only success/cache/ordinary loadMaterial fallback.",
    "Manifest itself still <=1MiB in original ordinary material lane; v3 is reference representation, not payload truncation/compression. Existing full source/head/Session/SEM/four reads/owning decoders/six document pin/body guards remain; P110 cash role applied only after original checks, no archived crop. New quotes only; existing commands/hashes/receipts/UNKNOWN unchanged."
  ],
